{{Quote|A short, curved sword with a basic hilt, a sailor's weapon of choice.|Item}}
The '''Cutlass''' is a {{Common}} [[sword]].

The cutlass allows the user to cast basic dash and slash attacks.

==Obtainment==
The Cutlass can be purchased for {{Money|1,000}} from the [[Sword Dealer]] at Pirate/Marine Starter.

